		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0223A643A5066452"]
			description: ["The electric piston is an electric-driven retroactivity device that converts the motor rotation to a straight-line retroactivity. Such a device could be used for various applications, such as compressors, aerodynamics, mechanical arms, etc."]
