			]
			description: [
				"A mechanical arm is a mechanical device imitating the function of a human arm, usually consisting of a series of poles and joints, capable of carrying out a complex range of movements, including rotation, bending and stretching. Mechanical arms can be programmed or remotely controlled to perform tasks such as handling, assembly, welding, spraying, surveying and exploration."
				"These parts can also be used as overlays."
