			description: ["The conveyor belt is a transport machine used to move materials or products from one location to another. It consists of one or more continuous band structures, which rotate around two rollers that act as drivers and support points. The conveyor belt can be operated horizontally, or tilted or vertically, to accommodate different port needs."]
